OL,3,GNEWSAMan guilty after sharing suicide
OL,4,Avest guide
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man accused of belonging to the
OL,7,FIslamic State (IS) group has been found
OL,8,Fguilty of terrorism offences.
OL,10,FAbdullah Yousef created a Telegram
OL,11,Fgroup where he published terrorist
OL,12,Fmaterial, including instructions on how
OL,13,Fto make suicide vests.
OL,15,FThe 24-year-old, of Galapagos Grove,
OL,16,FBletchley, Milton Keynes, also sent a
OL,17,Fmessage saying, "By the way, I am a
OL,18,Fterrorist".
